+# Graphical starter checkpoint
+
+This source-complete selector/adapter is independent of bike/navigation and map
+geometry. It uses four native animated icons and a selected 64x64 front sprite,
+name, type, level, highlight and A confirmation. B from confirmation returns
+to browsing; B in initial selection cannot leave an empty party. A successful
+screen returns an actual species ID through `VAR_RESULT` (4/1/7/25).
+
+The native one-time helper reads the current raw 40FC marker and party count.
+It returns 0 invalid, 1 newly granted or 2 already has partner. Only a successful
+`TaichungTeamSetSlot(0,species)` commits 40FC. The startup adapter runs supplies
+and story flags only on a new grant; existing parties/markers skip onboarding.
+No save version, geometry, browser or language-bridge change is included.
+
+The prototype startup adapter now puts the existing compact preferences after
+initial language choice and before the welcome/selector. Main owns the final
+welcome-room spawn and direct plaza transition. The exported adjacent labels
+`Taichung_OpeningGoOutside` / `Taichung_OpeningAlreadyDone` currently release
+controls; Main should bind the appropriate welcome-room continuation to the
+safe plaza anchor. Existing saves outside onboarding must not be moved.
